# Localization (Core)

**Never** hardcode user-facing text in Compose UI files.

## Structure

```
localization/Strings.kt    — shared property interface
localization/StringsTr.kt  — Turkish implementation
localization/StringsEn.kt  — English implementation
```

## Usage

```kotlin
// ❌ BAD
Text("Giriş Yap")

// ✅ GOOD
val strings = LocalStrings.current
Text(strings.loginButton)
```

## Adding a New String

1. Add property to `Strings.kt`
2. Add translation to `StringsTr.kt` **and** `StringsEn.kt`
3. **Check all three files** — duplicate property names cause Kotlin compile conflicts

Before adding, grep/search whether the key already exists in any of the three files.
